{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"清澈悬空、安静却不踏实\",\n          \"points\": [\"S01-B2-p1\", \"S01-B2-p2\", \"S01-B2-p3\", \"S01-B2-p4\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"平静底下有未说出口的波澜\",\n          \"points\": [\"S01-B1-p1\", \"S01-B1-p2\", \"S01-B1-p3\", \"S01-B1-p4\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"念头远远浮现，又慢慢退去\",\n          \"points\": [\"S01-B3-p1\", \"S01-B3-p2\"]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"tier_a\": [\"S01-B2-p1\"],\n      \"tier_b\": [\"S01-B2-p3\", \"S01-B1-p1\", \"S01-B1-p3\", \"S01-B3-p1\"],\n      \"only_one\": \"S01-B2-p1\",\n      \"line_order\": [\"S01-1\", \"S01-2\", \"S01-3\", \"S01-4\"],\n      \"line_a\": [\"S01-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"温柔怀念中压着失去的重量\",\n          \"points\": [\"S02-B1-p1\", \"S02-B1-p2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"生活仍在继续，身体往前而心留在过去\",\n          \"points\": [\"S02-B2-p1\", \"S02-B2-p2\", \"S02-B2-p3\", \"S02-B2-p4\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"想说出感受，却始终组织不好语言\",\n          \"points\": [\"S02-B3-p1\", \"S02-B3-p2\", \"S02-B3-p3\", \"S02-B3-p4\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"反复追问自己究竟舍不得什么\",\n          \"points\": [\"S02-B4-p1\", \"S02-B4-p2\", \"S02-B4-p3\", \"S02-B4-p4\"]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"tier_a\": [\"S02-B1-p2\"],\n      \"tier_b\": [\"S02-B1-p1\", \"S02-B2-p3\", \"S02-B2-p4\", \"S02-B3-p4\", \"S02-B4-p2\", \"S02-B4-p3\"],\n      \"only_one\": \"S02-B1-p2\",\n      \"line_order\": [\"S02-1\", \"S02-4\", \"S02-3\", \"S02-2\"],\n      \"line_a\": [\"S02-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"反复折返，执着追问如果当时不同会怎样\",\n          \"points\": [\"S03-B2-p1\", \"S03-B2-p2\", \"S03-B2-p3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"回忆重新变得清晰贴近，温柔中带着不安\",\n          \"points\": [\"S03-B1-p1\"